# IRC from the optimised TS, reusing the Hessian written by orca_ts.inp
# (orca_ts.hess) and its final geometry (orca_ts.xyz). Same functional/basis/
# solvent as the TS optimisation. The Cartesian constraints of the TS job are
# not part of this input: check that the frozen C-beta atoms stay in place.
! B3LYP D3BJ def2-SVP def2/J RIJCOSX CPCM(water) TightSCF IRC

%pal nprocs 16 end
%maxcore 3000

%cpcm
  epsilon 4.0
end

%irc
  MaxIter 60
  Direction both
  InitHess read
  Hess_Filename "orca_ts.hess"
  Monitor_Internals
    { B 1 51 }
  end
end

* xyzfile 1 1 orca_ts.xyz
